  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bali Process Administration and Coordination Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the work of the Bali Process through successfully logistically, administratively and technically aiding the conduct and coordination of the Bali Process&apos; various events (Ministerial meetings, Senior Officials&apos; meetings, Steering Group meetings, working group meetings, etc) and the direction of the Bali Process in general. Since its inception in 2002, the Bali Process on People Smuggling, Trafficking in Persons and Related Transnational Crime (Bali Process) has effectively raised regional awareness of the consequences of people smuggling, trafficking in persons and related transnational crime, and developed and implemented strategies and practical cooperation in response.</narrative>
  </description>
